{"parse":{"title":"特性/尖刺脊背","pageid":7282,"revid":17406,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>尖刺脊背</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.B0.96.E5.88.BA.E8.84.8A.E8.83.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"尖刺脊背\"><b>尖刺脊背</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 尖刺脊背.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/55/fxc90uedj9y120cnbatgafhn1q10mip.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/55/fxc90uedj9y120cnbatgafhn1q10mip.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/55/fxc90uedj9y120cnbatgafhn1q10mip.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />尖刺脊背\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦首次处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">120%</font>伤害。<br />✦场上有友军被击败时，攻击最近的敌人造成当前生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>伤害，每回合最多触发1次。<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">百分比穿透伤害</span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦免疫击退、打断。<br />✦物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>附加在物攻值上。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/尖刺脊背\"><img alt=\"尖刺脊背 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/l8ye8bjp80x41vczmxt27xmsu1o2mlx.png/75px-%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b3/l8ye8bjp80x41vczmxt27xmsu1o2mlx.png/113px-%E5%B0%96%E5%88%BA%E8%84%8A%E8%83%8C_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b3/l8ye8bjp80x41vczmxt27xmsu1o2mlx.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nC